   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Danger $$$** (1 other source): First performance in over 100 shows, opening the set with an early repertoire piece [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Danger $$$**: back after 234 archived shows (4139 days); rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Antarctica**: back after 31 archived shows (429 days) [3]\n- **Level 5**: rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Sapience**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Uqt**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **All Is Known**: back after 29 archived shows (428 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2026-10-18.h1n.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 14 songs; 144 min [1]\n- **kglw2026-10-18.h1n.flac16**: source not stated; 14 songs; 144 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Day two at the Block Party featured no power failures during the performance [1]\n- Uploader considers this performance superior to the previous day's show at the same event [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2026-10-18.h1n.flac24**: taped by Claire Laura Fredriksson; source: Zoom H1n internal mics, bass rolloff @ 80 Hz [1]\n- **kglw2026-10-18.h1n.flac16**: taped by Claire Laura Fredriksson; source: Zoom H1n internal mics, bass rolloff @ 80 Hz [2]",
